sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as Host cron<br/>(Europe/London)
    participant Bot as slack-task-bot
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant U as User<br/>(Slack DM)

    Note over Cron,U: 18:00 - evening triage
    Cron->>Bot: python -m ops.send_digest --type plan-evening
    Bot->>DB: select candidate tasks for tomorrow
    DB-->>Bot: tasks list
    Bot->>DB: insert daily_plan_items (excluded_at = NULL)
    Bot->>U: DM "Plan for tomorrow" + Skip buttons + Approve plan (optional)

    alt user clicks Skip on a task
        U->>Bot: button click
        Bot->>DB: set excluded_at on that item
        Bot->>U: ":heavy_minus_sign: Removed task #N from the plan"
    end

    alt user clicks Approve plan
        U->>Bot: button click
        Bot->>DB: write audit_logs action="approved"
        Bot->>U: ":white_check_mark: Plan accepted"
    end

    Note over Cron,U: 09:00 next day - execution
    Cron->>Bot: python -m ops.send_digest --type plan-morning
    Bot->>DB: select daily_plan_items WHERE excluded_at IS NULL
    DB-->>Bot: surviving items
    Bot->>DB: was approved? (audit_logs)

    alt was NOT approved
        Bot->>DB: write audit_logs action="auto_approved"
    end

    Bot->>U: DM "Today" cards + Tracking section<br/>(adds "wasn't approved - running as-is" note if auto-approved)
